Fuel Tracker — Support

Need help with Fuel Tracker? Here are answers to common questions.

GETTING STARTED
Add your first vehicle from the Vehicles tab, then log a fill-up with the liters, price (per liter or total — the app calculates the other), and current odometer reading.

HOW IS FUEL CONSUMPTION CALCULATED?
Mark a fill-up as "full tank" whenever you fill the tank completely. Consumption (L/100km) is calculated most accurately between two full-tank fill-ups.

HOW DO MAINTENANCE REMINDERS WORK?
Set up a maintenance task with a target mileage and/or date (e.g. oil change at 158,000 km). Enable notifications when prompted, and you'll be alerted as the threshold approaches or if it's overdue. Recurring tasks automatically create their next occurrence once marked complete.

WHERE IS MY DATA STORED?
All data stays on your device only — there's no account and no cloud sync. If you delete the app, your data is permanently removed.

CAN I TRY THE APP WITHOUT ENTERING REAL DATA?
Yes — go to Settings and tap "Load demo data" to explore the app with sample entries.

